{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：平安银行二季度业绩符合预期，零售资产质量持续改善</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">平安银行<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>业绩没有太多意外，但报告里透露出的结构变化值得留意。GS在最新业绩点评中更新公司观点，同时小幅上调了<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>的盈利预测。这家机构认为，平安银行正在从过去几年以不确定性化解和资产负债表修复为主的阶段，转向由零售资产质量<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>、负债成本优化、财富管理<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>和股东回报提升共同驱动的新周期。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>平安银行营业收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">353亿元</span>，同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>；净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">112亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>。上半年累计营收<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">706亿元</span>，净利润<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">257亿元</span>，分别同比变动2%和3%。GS指出，实际业绩略好于其预期的部分，主要来自拨备和税费支出低于预估。换句话说，经营层面的改善还没有完全体现在收入端，但成本端的不确定性正在减轻。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVXVfOZILIF3LIDibSoG33wlSY3ic5n7pXUicbHAzGrqCr4Ir9LFib6sQwUtIZPEiaTJpNgoPrmkibUXYGyzK9xTlRgX2HkNnabA4YHM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 净息差企稳背后，负债成本优化仍在继续</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>平安银行净利息收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">222亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>。GS计算的净息差为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.51%</span>，同比和环比均下降1个基点，基本保持稳定。上半年净息差<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.50%</span>，同比下降5个基点，与预期一致。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">息差企稳的关键在负债端。报告提到，平安银行近年来持续压降高成本存款，零售活期存款占比从约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">25%</span>缓慢提升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">26%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">27%</span>。存贷比升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">93%</span>，存款增长不确定性有所缓解。但GS同时提示，行业层面负债竞争依然激烈，存款成本仍有上行不确定性，息差进一步<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>的驱动因素并不明显。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看存贷比这个数字，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">93%</span>意味着贷款增速持续高于存款，银行依赖市场化负债补缺口的程度在上升。简单说，息差企稳更多是靠资产端定价和负债成本同步节奏变化形成的均衡，而不是某一端出现明显<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">拐点</span>；后续更值得观察的是零售活期占比能否延续缓慢爬升，这决定了负债成本优化的空间还有多大。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOULCfQ2VCj6NWgymINEOGZdrVP17KqyBic0nBfh9gibOR2llBBeuEEeDhIUbFTcyRgkMOQGBzzrDa9llEIK4un1JpjRDvicIBecnA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 零售贷款结构分化，信用卡业务仍在影响中间收入</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">贷款增长保持温和。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>末贷款余额<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.45万亿</span>元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>，环比基本持平。其中企业贷款同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.1%</span>，零售贷款仅增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.1%</span>。零售贷款内部，按揭贷款同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，非按揭零售贷款下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>，经营性贷款下降5%。传统零售信贷需求依然偏弱。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这种结构分化也反映在中间业务收入上。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>手续费收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">59亿元</span>，同比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>，环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">21%</span>，比GS预期低<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>。报告认为，财富管理相关业务延续高增长，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>财富管理手续费收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55%</span>，二季度增速依然较快；但信用卡和部分传统零售中间业务仍处于恢复期，影响整体手续费表现。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVkkIr1BWql90PWmTDpgStOZSiaUcoXUMgRaWkjbVBZpNIh6xDNUpaUXYic7ibT3LjHEzrIjNGA1lUV9OoUG2JfGvbx9NsGZKAJWM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 不确定性加权资产增速快于资产，资本消耗结构值得关注</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>末不确定性加权资产达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.89万亿</span>元，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>，明显快于贷款和总资产增速。不确定性加权资产密度升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">81.2%</span>，环比上升144个基点，同比上升378个基点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS认为，这主要因为新增贷款更多集中在资本消耗较高的企业业务，同时票据融资等临时性业务占用了不确定性加权资产。报告预计，后者的影响在未来几个月会逐步减弱。但企业贷款占比上升带来的资本消耗不确定性，短期内不会消失。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUdtHtdlrgMInBC9wtiaNO2aalEibEohwUpCQXgEfibsdVrEriaXSbt5XicE0HicfW5TR1a1skOzBRZp2mf3JDtSoxicEAKS2HUbuAcC8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 30-GS-Ping An Bank Co. -000001-Earnings Review- Largely In Line- Continued Improvement in Retail Asset Quality with Focus on Wealth Management and Shareholder R</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
